{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98316","id":2133082509,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc5_JEGN","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98316","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98316.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98316.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98316","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98316/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98316/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98316/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/cbc3a4a4df8c1c96d1414ea7cfd47b6b935fa836","number":98316,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Check resource loader return for Script during GDScript analyzer","user":{"login":"fwsGonzo","id":3758947,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTg5NDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3758947?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwsGonzo","html_url":"https://github.com/fwsGonzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwsGonzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwsGonzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwsGonzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwsGonzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwsGonzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwsGonzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwsGonzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwsGonzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwsGonzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The resource loader can attempt to load a Script that doesn't exist (yet), returns the null resource and the GDAnalyzer will crash\r\n\r\nThis is the result of a regression since 4.4 where the order of loading has changed. Although I don't fully understand the new order, it seems to always load GDScripts first, analyzing them, and crashing on a not-yet loaded/usable script type. In my case the not-yet loaded script type is assigned to an `@export var`, and the type is not loadable for various reasons.\r\n\r\nThese changes are enough to get the editor and game to start and run again, by failing the scripts. Which in turn allowed me to work on the project to fix the problems.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2024-10-18T20:08:33Z","updated_at":"2024-10-20T12:35:09Z","closed_at":"2024-10-20T12:13:51Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"7c6e6dc258b368c77acfa8fb8a67e28e3af3865d","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"fwsGonzo:fix_4.4_resource_loading_regression","ref":"fix_4.4_resource_loading_regression","repo":{"id":575533421,"node_id":"R_kgDOIk3x